    "description": {
      "value": "This ice-blue half-mask is adorned with a wicked silver grin that covers the wearer's mouth, leaving the rest of the face uncovered. You gain a +2 item bonus to Intimidation checks. The mask emits a soul-chilling scream that deals 6d10 negative damage to each living creature in a 20-foot emanation (DC 25 basic Fortitude save). The item bonus to Intimidation is +3. Activating a greater mask of the banshee casts a 9th-level wail of the banshee (DC 41) affecting all living creatures in the area. Craft Requirements: Supply a casting of wail of the banshee."
    },
